Provided within the archive, the nice tool TOOLTYPE will help you to
edit the tooltypes in the doors's icon. I know that editing tooltypes
can be *very* boring, and a bit tricky when you want to insert ansi
codes, cut/paste, etc...
 
A warning though... this tool doesn't recognize the .INFO, you must
give the program name and not the icon name ! I am not the coder, don't
blame me for this non-sense ;)   Coders know why it is so, but I think
that a small test routine would have solved the problem. Anyway, you must
for example give DOOR and not DOOR.INFO
 
I wish to thank the author of TOOLTYPE for his nice contribution to the
Amiga community !
 
